# =============================================================================
# CS 435 AI Interview Practice Interface — Environment Configuration Template
# =============================================================================
# INSTRUCTIONS:
# 1. Copy this file to '.env' in the project root:
#      cp .env.example .env      (or copy .env.example .env on Windows)
# 2. Add your Google Gemini API key below.
# 3. IMPORTANT: '.env' is listed in '.gitignore' and will NEVER be committed to GitHub.
# =============================================================================

# Google Gemini API Key (Primary & Only Cloud AI Provider)
# 1. Generate an API key at https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# 2. Paste your key after the '=' below:
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
